  "header": "The agent gets a computer, a sign-in it cannot see, and a bank that says no",
  "friendlyHeader": "Agents get their own computer. Banks are closing the door.",
  "summary": "Today's issue is about the plumbing around agents, not a new chatbot. Anthropic is handing its skill format to a shared foundation. 1Password will fill a login without giving the password to the agent. Major US banks are starting to block agents that sign in with a customer's own credentials. Google has built a separate microVM for each Gemini agent, and is opening that design later. OpenAI's Decisions API is now generally available for the small choices an app makes thousands of times a day.",
  "friendlySummary": "Today is about the pipes around agents, not a new chatbot. Anthropic is giving its skill format to a shared group, so more tools can use the same files. 1Password can fill a login without showing the password to the agent. Big US banks are starting to block agents that sign in with a customer's own password. Google has built a small separate computer for each Gemini agent, and will open that design later. OpenAI's Decisions API is now open for the small choices an app makes many times a day.",
